% composition-bridge: Listen for massed percussion, a declarative chorus and identity carried through ensemble sound.
% composition-context: Ilê Aiyê is a bloco afro founded in Salvador, Bahia, with Black cultural and political significance. This original school signal is not samba-reggae or an Ilê Aiyê arrangement.
% composition-distance: Original tune, words and percussion-neutral score; no chorus, drum part or arrangement from the recording is copied.
