% dossier-honesty: Original syncopation study; bloco afro music is taught through the actual recording and history.
% dossier-licence: Draft original; Ilê Aiyê's music and recording remain copyrighted.
% dossier-respect: Teach the ensemble's Black Brazilian political context; do not use costumes or generic "carnival" framing.
% dossier-review: Afro-Brazilian/Bahia music educator and Grade 4 teacher.
